      "cooked": "<p>Hello Folks this thread will be for anything and everything that has to do wth the updates for this final expantion . I think it's a good idea to keep things to a single thread so it's easy to find . Fpr ore one the final expantion please visit my other thread on the subjuect - https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-oblivaeon-main-thread-8324</p><p>I will be talking about my view on the updates so far and let me tell you there is alot to talk about so lets begin with UPDATE #1</p><h2>UPDATE # 1 </h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h4>Omnitron- u seems like this character could be a vilian in the future but onlytime will tell . There might be more to this but for now that is what I am getting from it . P.s . not liking the new design but it might frow on me&nbsp;</h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Parse -</h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>StuntMan</h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Sky Scrapper </h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><b>Fort Adamant</b></h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><b>Captain Cosmic </b></h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>The Visionary</h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Freedom Five Annual #30 </h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4>Still editing <br><br>&nbsp;</h4>",
